                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> """Wherever category B is not needed, generally the category A has to be understood as the default value.  None  shall be selected when none of A or B fire category is applied for a specific tunnel.
For tunnels shorter than 1km, the fire category according to SRT TSI does not exist."""@en .


###  http://data.europa.eu/949/routeBookObjectParameter
